      "text": {
        "jp": "今日一日くらいは動けんかと思ったが\r\n思ったよりタフなようじゃ。",
        "official_en": "I thought she’d have to stay in bed all day. She’s tougher than she looks.",
        "real_en": "I thought she wouldn't be able to move for the whole day, but she's tougher than I expected."
